
  Use the packet stream at the given endpoint

  A packet streamer provides the emulator with a set of emulated radio devices
  The address should follow the gRPC name resolution as explained in detail:
  here: https://grpc.github.io/grpc/cpp/md_doc_naming.html. 

  NOTE: This is currently under active development (b/265451720). 
  providing this parameter will currently enable the default packet streamer. 


